 2,035 m, lifts 2,789 m); rescue via 112","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/italy","read":"2026-08-20T14:47:59Z","page_updated":"2026-08-11T14:10:14+01:00","source_country":"italy","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb settimana bianca half-terms, Easter; highest rates + min-stay","shoulder":"Early Dec (season open, snow-sure high base) + late-season Mar-Apr spring skiing","green":"Between seasons May-Jun + Oct-Nov (lowest rates, limited opening); Jul-Sep separate golf/hiking green season","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb white weeks + World Cup weekends 3-6 mo; regular winter 1-3 mo; summer 1-2 mo","off_season_specials":"Summer golf (one of Europe''s highest) + hiking/e-bike (Jul-Sep); spring-ski value (late Mar-Apr); Turin 2006 20th-anniversary heritage breaks","event_peaks":"Ski holidays (Dec-Apr), Feb settimana bianca, FIS World Cup weekends (verify), Easter skiing, summer golf","fire_date":"Next winter + Feb white weeks by late summer; summer golf/hiking from spring; spring-ski + Turin-2006-20th anniversary across 2025/26"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski the whole Milky Way on one pass — ~400 km cross-border","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"essential","price_band":"lift ~EUR 55-66/day; private instructor ~EUR 200-350/day (approx)","timing":"ski ~Dec-Apr; verify","draw_rank":1,"hook":"link Sestriere, Sauze d''Oulx, San Sicario, Claviere and French Montgenèvre across 400 km of mostly intermediate pistes on a single Vialattea ticket","si":"ski","blurb":"link Sestriere, Sauze d''Oulx, San Sicario, Claviere and French Montgenèvre across 400 km of mostly intermediate pistes on a single Vialattea ticket","when":"ski ~Dec-Apr; verify","commission":"school/operator 10-15%","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["ski"],"shelf_fit"