me to visit Dubai?","a":"November-March is the cool, dry season and the event peak (including the Shopping Festival); summer (Jun-Sep) is very hot, routinely above 40C. This is planning-only guidance while the destination is held content-only.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Dubai (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"Is there anything specific to know about safety in the city itself?","a":"Beyond the regional conflict and the airspace risk, Dubai''s own street-crime level is low; Re-verify the advisory before acting on anything here.","source":"levels supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read; en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Dubai (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_description":"Held content-only.","slug":"dubai-uae","primary_keyword":"Dubai travel advisory 2026","long_tail":["Dubai safety 2026","UAE airspace disruption","Dubai Shopping Festival","Burj Khalifa"],"search_language":"ar (restated, not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["دبي","برج خليفة","تحذير السفر دبي"],"hreflang":["en","ar"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-10","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-10","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/united-arab-emirates","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:52Z","source_updated":"2026-07-24T15:52:23+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"booking_hold":true,"codes":[],"note":"HELD CONTENT-ONLY. Iranian retaliatory missile/drone strikes on all six GCC states; Strait of Hormuz closed to commercial shipping; CITATION: level+conflict supplied by Strategy Claude from 